{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19301","headline":"省试风光草际浮 · 刘禹锡","name":"省试风光草际浮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"熙熙春景霁，草绿春光丽。\n的历乱相鲜，葳蕤互亏蔽。\n乍疑芊绵里，稍动丰茸际。\n影碎翻崇兰，浮香转丛蕙。\n含烟绚碧彩，带露如珠缀。\n幸因采掇日，况此临芳岁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19301.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19301","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}